Description: fbdev: imxfb: switch off the graphic window left on by the boot
 The i.MX21 and i.MX27 LCDC blend a second plane, the graphic window, over
 the screen when LGWCR's GWE bit is set. The driver doesn't use the window
 and never wrote the register, so a kernel handed off from a running system
 inherits it: the Chumby's stock firmware leaves it on, and once its memory
 belongs to someone else the screen shows that memory blended over the
 console. Clear it whenever the controller is programmed.
